      "questionHead": "q54 later aside",
      "text": "q54 later aside",
      "carriedSubscriptionField": true,
      "subscriptionId": "48d28379a6854a04927c8b24f2f535f9",
      "status": 200,
      "response": "{\"status\":200,\"message\":\"Desktop session result.\",\"result\":{\"data\":{\"aside_id\":\"58fbec31-9e4a-4bcc-bcd3-1c4828869803\",\"text\":\"Transport failures and owner **5xx** responses, per provider, inside a moving window.\\n\\n- each transport failure spends one\\n- each owner 5xx spends one\\n- a retry that succeeds resets the window\\n\\nA **4xx** never spends it: the request was wrong, not the provider.\",\"off_record\":true},\"replayed\":false}}"
    },
